<div class="hero">
  <div class="badge">English Bulldog Cost Guide 2025</div>
  <h1>How much does an English Bulldog <em>really</em> cost?</h1>
  <p>Bulldogs are among the most lovable dogs alive — and among the most expensive to keep healthy. Get the real numbers before you fall for that face.</p>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="hstat"><span class="n">$2,500+</span><span class="l">Average purchase price</span></div>
    <div class="hstat"><span class="n">$5,800</span><span class="l">First year total cost</span></div>
